, R26, R23, R24, R27, R28` as 0-ohm resistors.\n2.  Connect these resistors to the appropriate `CBx` and `VCx` nets.\n3.  Connect U1's `CB0` to `CB16` pins to their respective nets.\n4.  Connect U1's `VC0` to `VC16` pins to their respective nets.\n    *Note: The SCUD explicitly mentions connections for `CB12` to `CB16` and `VC12` to `VC16`. For the remaining `CBx` and `VCx` pins (0-11), I will connect them to their respective nets for completeness, assuming they are routed to these nets within the IC.*"}, {'function_call': {'name': 'file_editor', 'args': {'old_str': '      <trace from=".Q1 > .base" to="net.NPNB" />', 'security_risk': 'LOW', 'command': 'str_replace', 'path': '/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_circuit.tsx', 'new_str': '      <trace from=".Q1 > .base" to="net.NPNB" />\n\n      {/* Cell Balance (CB) Configuration Path (0-ohm, DNP) */}\n      <resistor name="R25" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n      <resistor name="R21" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n      <resistor name="R26" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n      <resistor name="R22" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n\n      <trace from="net.CB12" to=".R25 > .pin1" />\n      <trace from=".R25 > .pin2" to="net.CB13" />\n      <trace from="net.CB13" to=".R21 > .pin1" />\n      <trace from=".R21 > .pin2" to="net.CB14" />\n      <trace from="net.CB14" to=".R26 > .pin1" />\n      <trace from=".R26 > .pin2" to="net.CB15" />\n      <trace from="net.CB15" to=".R22 > .pin1" />\n      <trace from=".R22 > .pin2" to="net.CB16" />\n\n      {/* Voltage Sense (VC) Configuration Path (0-ohm, DNP) */}\n      <resistor name="R27" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n      <resistor name="R23" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n      <resistor name="R28" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n      <resistor name="R24" resistance="0" footprint="0603" />\n\n      <trace from="net.VC12" to=".R27 > .pin1" />\n      <trace from=".R27 > .pin2" to="net.VC13" />\n      <t