nd does not execute any code or make changes.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'description': 'Action for logging a thought without making any changes.', 'properties': {'thought': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'The thought to log.'}}, 'required': ['thought']}}]}], 'generationConfig': {'max_output_tokens': 65535, 'thinkingConfig': {'thinkingBudget': 4096, 'includeThoughts': True}}}'
