                             Interface (J4):** Connecting BMS `GPIOx` pins to `GPIOx_R` via J4.\n5.  **Channel 1 Filter:**              
                             Special filter for `GPIO1_R` consisting of R128, C60, and D3.\n6.  **DNP Components:** R20                 
                             (100k) and C12 (DNP) on RT8 channel.\n\n**Plan for next iteration:**\n\n1.  Declare new nets:              
