                             (150060GS75000), D3 (BZX84C24), RT1-RT8 (NCP18XH103F03RB), resistors, capacitors, and                      
                             jumpers.\n3.  **Implement Power & Decoupling:**\n    *   Input Filter (R5, C5).\n    *   NPN               
                             Supply (R4, R3, C1, Q1).\n    *   Internal Regulator Decoupling (C6, C9, C7, C8, C59, C3,                  
                             C2).\n    *   Isolator Power Decoupling (C57, C58).\n    *   Power Indicator (D1, R121,                    
