                             nets.\n5.  **Implement Auxiliary Measurement Inputs:**\n    *   Bus Bar Filter (R9, R12, C10,              
                             R10, R13).\n    *   Current Sense Filter (C11, R17).\n    *   Test Points (TP16, TP17, TP18,               
                             TP19).\n    *   Connect U1's BBP/BBN pins.\n6.  **Implement Temperature Measurement                        
