o, the connections will be: `VCC` to `J6`, then from `J6` to `R121`, and then `D1` to GND.\n\nFinally, I'll add connections for `CVDD` to `CVDD_CO` via `J18`, a 2-pin header. I'll declare the `CVDD_CO` net. Then, I will instantiate `J18` and then connect `CVDD` to one pin of `J18` and `CVDD_CO` to the other pin of `J18`. \n", 'signature': None}], 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_e1eb3fc431bb4dc99ccfc2740445', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'file_editor', 'arguments': '{"command": "str_replace", "path": "/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_circuit.tsx", "old_str": "      <net name=\\"CB16\\" />\\n\\n      {/* U1: BQ79616PAPQ1 (Main BMS IC) */}", "security_risk": "LOW", "new_str": "      <net name=\\"CB16\\" />\\n\\n      {/* New Nets for Isolator Power and Power Indicator */}\\n      <net name=\\"USB2ANY_3_3V\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"CVDD_CO\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"POWER_IND\\" />\\n\\n      {/* U1: BQ79616PAPQ1 (Main BMS IC) */}"}'}}]}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'The file /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_circuit.tsx has been edited. Here\'s the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_circuit.tsx:\n    56\t      <net name="CB13" />\n    57\t      <net name="CB14" />\n    58\t      <net name="CB15" />\n    59\t      <net name="CB16" />\n    60\t\n    61\t      {/* New Nets for Isolator Power and Power Indicator */}\n    62\t      <net name="USB2ANY_3_3V" />\n    63\t      <net name="CVDD_CO" />\n    64\t      <net name="POWER_IND" />\n    65\t\n    66\t      {/* U1: BQ79616PAPQ1 (Main BMS IC) */}\n    67\t      <BQ79616PAPR name="U1" />\n    68\t      {/* U2: ISO7342CQDWRQ1 (Digital Isolator) */}\n    69\t      <ISO7342FCQDWRQ1 name="U2" />\n    70\t\n    71\t\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected. Edit the file again if necessary.'}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call