                             `.cathode` and `.anode` or `.pin1` and `.pin2`. If `.cathode` and `.anode` are the correct pin             
                             names, they should be updated for consistency and clarity.\\n\\n2.  **DNP Components R20 and               
                             C12 (Connection Logic):** The traces for DNP (Do Not Populate) components R20 and C12 are                  
                             defined as connecting between `net.GPIO1_R` and `.RT8 > .pin1` (lines 267-271).\\n    *                    
                             `R20: <trace from=\\\"net.GPIO1_R\\\" to=\\\".R20 > .pin1\\\" /><trace from=\\\".RT8 >                     
                             .pin1\\\" to=\\\".R20 > .pin2\\\" />`\\n    *   `C12: <trace from=\\\"net.GPIO1_R\\\"                      
                             to=\\\".C12 > .pin1\\\" /><trace from=\\\".RT8 > .pin1\\\" to=\\\".C12 > .pin2\\\" />`\\n                  
                             This connection pattern (`.RT8 > .pin1`) is still problematic. If R20 and C12 are meant to be              
